        <section class="section philosophy" id="philosophy"><div class="container philosophy-grid"><div class="section-intro reveal"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> A different kind of market education</p><h2>Trading is not prediction.<br><em>It is decision-making</em><br>under uncertainty.</h2><p class="body-copy">The market does not owe us certainty. Mwanafunzi Investor exists to help you build a process that can hold up when certainty is impossible — through probability, rules and responsible risk.</p><a class="text-link" href="#framework">Discover the framework <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="philosophy-visual reveal reveal-delay-1"><div class="photo-card photo-card-back" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="photo-card photo-card-main"><div class="desk-scene"><span class="desk-sun"></span><span class="desk-paper paper-one"></span><span class="desk-paper paper-two"></span><span class="desk-pencil"></span></div><div class="visual-caption"><span>Study the process</span><strong>01</strong></div></div><div class="circle-note"><span>Always a<br><em>mwanafunzi.</em></span><i>↗</i></div></div></div><div class="container pillars reveal"><div class="pillar"><span>01</span><strong>Student of Money</strong><p>Stay curious. Study the relationships behind the price.</p></div><div class="pillar"><span>02</span><strong>Systems over signals</strong><p>Turn ideas into rules you can test, repeat and review.</p></div><div class="pillar"><span>03</span><strong>Probability + discipline</strong><p>Respect the sample size, the risk and the work.</p></div></div></section>

        <section class="section services-section" id="learn"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading split-heading reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> Start with a stronger foundation</p><h2>Build the habits<br>behind the <em>chart.</em></h2></div><p class="body-copy">Four practical entry points for replacing noise with a calm, structured way of thinking about markets.</p></div><div class="service-grid">@php $services = [['01', '◒', 'Forex Core Basics — No BS', 'Understand the language of the market, from currency pairs to the forces that move them.'], ['02', '⌁', 'Mechanical Analysis Concepts, Rules & Execution', 'Learn how to translate an idea into a repeatable, testable decision process.'], ['03', '◌', 'Risk Planning', 'Make position size, exposure and the cost of being wrong part of the plan.'], ['04', '↗', 'Running Trade Risk Management', 'Manage an open position with rules that protect your thinking as conditions change.']]; @endphp @foreach ($services as $service)<a class="service-card reveal" href="#contact"><div class="card-top"><span class="card-number">{{ $service[0] }}</span><span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ $service[1] }}</span></div><h3>{{ $service[2] }}</h3><p>{{ $service[3] }}</p><span class="card-link">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>@endforeach</div></div></section>

        <section class="framework-section" id="framework"><div class="container"><div class="framework-header reveal"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> A process you can come back to</p><h2>The Student of Money<br><em>Framework.</em></h2><p>Good decisions become easier when they have somewhere to live.</p></div><div class="framework-steps">@php $steps = [['01', 'Learn', 'Understand the market and your own assumptions.'], ['02', 'Define Rules', 'Write down what must be true before you act.'], ['03', 'Plan Risk', 'Decide what you can responsibly put at risk.'], ['04', 'Execute', 'Follow the plan without negotiating with fear.'], ['05', 'Journal', 'Capture the decision while the context is clear.'], ['06', 'Review', 'Look for patterns across a meaningful sample.'], ['07', 'Improve', 'Make one thoughtful change at a time.']]; @endphp @foreach ($steps as $step)<div class="framework-step reveal"><span>{{ $step[0] }}</span><strong>{{ $step[1] }}</strong><p>{{ $step[2] }}</p></div>@endforeach</div></div></section>

