        <section class="section probability-section" id="about"><div class="container probability-grid"><div class="probability-copy reveal"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> The mathematics of staying in the game</p><h2>You don't need to be right on <em>every trade.</em></h2><p class="body-copy">You need controlled losses, repeatable execution and an edge that can express itself across a meaningful sample of trades.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="#contact">Learn risk management <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="dashboard-card reveal reveal-delay-1"><div class="dashboard-header"><span>PROCESS DASHBOARD</span><span class="dashboard-status"><i></i> No results fabricated</span></div><div class="dashboard-body"><div class="dashboard-graph"><div class="graph-labels"><span>EDGE</span><span>TIME →</span></div><svg viewBox="0 0 520 220" role="img" aria-label="Abstract process line showing variation over time"><path d="M0 171 C40 169 50 110 83 123 S124 163 154 123 S195 81 224 118 S265 177 294 136 S330 82 362 104 S395 131 421 83 S472 79 520 34" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M0 181 C40 179 50 154 83 164 S124 180 154 156 S195 134 224 151 S265 185 294 162 S330 145 362 147 S395 162 421 128 S472 121 520 89" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity=".25" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 5"/></svg></div><div class="dashboard-metrics"><div><span>Risk per trade</span><strong>Defined</strong></div><div><span>Expected R</span><strong>Tested</strong></div><div><span>Sample size</span><strong>Respected</strong></div><div><span>Execution quality</span><strong>Reviewed</strong></div></div></div></div></div></section>

        <section class="discipline-section"><div class="container discipline-grid"><div class="discipline-mark reveal" aria-hidden="true">✦</div><div class="discipline-copy reveal reveal-delay-1"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> The work beyond the chart</p><h2>Discipline <em>Beyond</em><br>The Charts.</h2><p>Patience. Stewardship. Self-control. Humility. Consistency. Responsibility.</p><p class="discipline-small">Financial education is also an education in how we carry uncertainty. The point is not perfection — it is becoming trustworthy with the decisions in front of you.</p></div></div></section>

        <section class="section journal-section" id="journal"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading split-heading reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> Field notes, when there are field notes</p><h2>Real Updates.<br><em>Real Journey.</em></h2></div><p class="body-copy">The journal will be a living record of the work: reviews, lessons and ideas worth returning to. No invented headlines. No made-up results.</p></div><div class="journal-empty reveal"><div class="empty-index">J / 00</div><div><h3>The next entry is being studied.</h3><p>When a new note is published, it will appear here from the connected journal source.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="mailto:mwanafunziinvestor@outlook.com?subject=Journal%20updates">Ask for updates <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>

